      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so it's mostly just legal and banking stuff to keep it safe. it just feels a bit weird to have all that cash just sitting there in limbo. is there any kind of risk that the agent might, i don't know, get greedy or something? like what stops them from just holding onto it too long or acting sketchy with it?",
